<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Leonida Platinum — GTA VI Trophy Guide &amp; Tracker</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="masthead-title">
    <h1>LEONIDA PLATINUM</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Grand Theft Auto VI — PlayStation 5 trophy guide &amp; tracker. All 55 official
    trophies: 1 platinum, 2 gold, 6 silver, 46 bronze. Names, descriptions and grades as
    PlayStation publishes them; every guide in our own words, with its sources named.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="platinum-box" id="platinumBox" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="platinum-count"><span id="earnedCount">0</span><span class="of">/ 55</span></div>
    <div class="platinum-bar"><div class="platinum-fill" id="platinumFill"></div></div>
    <p class="platinum-label" id="platinumLabel">0% to the platinum</p>
    <p class="grade-counts" id="gradeCounts"></p>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs" aria-label="Guide sections">
  <a href="#checklist" data-view="checklist" class="tab">Checklist</a>
  <a href="#roadmap" data-view="roadmap" class="tab">Roadmap to Platinum</a>
  <a href="#missables" data-view="missables" class="tab">Missables <span class="tab-count" id="missableTabCount"></span></a>
  <a href="#planner" data-view="planner" class="tab">Planner &amp; Save</a>
</nav>

<section id="view-checklist" class="view">
  <div class="toolbar">
    <input id="searchBox" type="search" placeholder="Search trophies, missions, collectibles…" aria-label="Search trophies">
    <div class="chips" id="kindChips" role="group" aria-label="Filter by kind">
      <button type="button" data-kind="all" class="chip active">All</button>
      <button type="button" data-kind="story" class="chip">Story</button>
      <button type="button" data-kind="missable" class="chip">Missable</button>
      <button type="button" data-kind="collectible" class="chip">Collectibles</button>
      <button type="button" data-kind="activity" class="chip">Activities</button>
      <button type="button" data-kind="online" class="chip">Online</button>
    </div>
    <label class="grade-pick">Grade
      <select id="gradeFilter">
        <option value="all">All grades</option>
        <option value="platinum">Platinum</option>
        <option value="gold">Gold</option>
        <option value="silver">Silver</option>
        <option value="bronze">Bronze</option>
      </select>
    </label>
    <label class="switch"><input id="spoilerToggle" type="checkbox" checked> Hide story spoilers</label>
    <label class="switch"><input id="earnedOnlyToggle" type="checkbox"> Earned only</label>
  </div>
  <p class="spoiler-note" id="spoilerNote">Spoiler protection is ON: story trophies you have not earned yet show as
  “Hidden trophy” until you tick them off. Turn it off to see every name and description.</p>
  <div class="checklist-layout">
    <main class="trophy-list" id="trophyList" aria-live="polite"></main>
    <aside class="detail" id="detailPanel" aria-label="Trophy guide detail"></aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="view-roadmap" class="view" hidden>
  <h2>Roadmap to the platinum</h2>
  <p class="view-intro">The order to earn them in, built from the official descriptions: which story
  chapters and missions first, then the finale and 100% completion, then activities and
  skills, then collectibles and cleanup. Each stage shows its own progress — finish a
  stage before the next one where the guide says so.</p>
  <div class="roadmap" id="roadmapStages"></div>
</section>

<section id="view-missables" class="view" hidden>
  <h2>Missable trophies — do these when you see them</h2>
  <p class="view-intro">A trophy is flagged missable when its official description ties it to a single
  story moment or a one-off situation with no stated way to repeat it. Mission replay in
  GTA VI is unconfirmed, so treat every flagged trophy as “do it when you see it”.
  Flags are our own reading of the official descriptions — not verified in-game.</p>
  <div class="missable-list" id="missableList"></div>
</section>

<section id="view-planner" class="view" hidden>
  <h2>Planner &amp; save</h2>
  <div class="planner-grid">
    <div class="planner-card" id="nextUpCard">
      <h3>Next up</h3>
      <p class="card-hint">The three earliest roadmap trophies you have not earned yet.</p>
      <ol class="next-up" id="nextUpList"></ol>
    </div>
    <div class="planner-card">
      <h3>Progress by stage</h3>
      <div id="stageProgress"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="planner-card">
      <h3>Your save file</h3>
      <p class="card-hint">Progress, notes and settings live in this browser (localStorage).
      Export a backup file, or import one to restore it on another machine.</p>
      <div class="save-buttons">
        <button id="exportBtn" type="button">Export progress (.json)</button>
        <label class="import-btn">Import progress <input id="importFile" type="file" accept="application/json,.json"></label>
      </div>
      <p class="save-status" id="saveStatus">No backup exported yet this session.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="planner-card">
      <h3>Target date</h3>
      <p class="card-hint">Pick the day you want the platinum by — the planner works out how many
      trophies a day that means.</p>
      <label class="target-row">Platinum by <input id="targetDate" type="date"></label>
      <p class="target-result" id="targetResult">Choose a date to see your daily pace.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="sources">
  <h3>Where every fact comes from</h3>
  <p><strong>Names, descriptions and grades:</strong> the official PlayStation 5 list as
  mirrored by Exophase and PSNProfiles (the two agree on all 55). <strong>Counts</strong>
  (42 Shooting Range challenges, 14 drone-race locations, 18 meditation spots, 100 WAiNK
  locations, 100 vehicles, 52 areas, 9 gangs, 8 garages, 500 choices) come from the
  official descriptions themselves. <strong>Guides:</strong> written for this entry in our
  own words from those descriptions — locations and steps we could not confirm are
  marked “not verified in-game” rather than guessed. <strong>Hidden flags</strong> follow
  the PSN listing (28 hidden). No Rockstar logo, artwork, box art or game screenshot is
  used anywhere in this guide; the look is our own.</p>
</footer>

<script type="module" src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

